WEBVTT

00:08.690 --> 00:12.950
Dawn was about to break for the lightless sky.

00:12.950 --> 00:17.910
Just like the countless raindrops
falling into the ocean to melt into one,

00:18.620 --> 00:21.330
the hearts of everyone will become one.

00:22.660 --> 00:24.830
Everything from their hatred, anger, happiness,

00:25.330 --> 00:26.330
and sins...

00:27.040 --> 00:29.920
Everything melts away into the sea foam and disappears.

00:31.670 --> 00:35.550
With this, my sadness will be gone.

00:39.390 --> 00:40.600
Why am I...

00:41.310 --> 00:44.560
Unable to locate Argent or Gueules.

00:48.940 --> 00:51.030
Tsugumi-san!

00:51.440 --> 00:54.240
Can you tell us a few things?

00:58.450 --> 01:02.040
The Dark Metal

00:58.450 --> 00:58.490
The Dark Metal

01:02.450 --> 01:06.960
Episode 24
Original Sin, Past and Future

01:05.540 --> 01:07.420
So everyone becomes one?

01:08.170 --> 01:10.670
Is that the revenge the people of Yomijima seek?

01:13.130 --> 01:16.840
So that's just what Minashi thinks...

01:17.470 --> 01:18.800
Is there any way to stop it?

01:18.800 --> 01:20.180
Like I would know that.

01:21.390 --> 01:24.930
The Corpse can't be stopped now.

01:25.770 --> 01:27.480
Is that your wish as well?

01:28.770 --> 01:32.690
I don't know.

01:33.150 --> 01:36.900
But I don't want to be alone anymore.

01:37.240 --> 01:39.410
I don't want to feel lonely...

01:39.410 --> 01:43.160
Nor do I want to be scared or be blamed for anything...

01:46.870 --> 01:47.790
What?

01:47.790 --> 01:49.250
I'm not the only one at fault.

01:50.590 --> 01:51.380
Yeah.

02:00.640 --> 02:03.720
You have feelings of fear inside you too.

02:04.560 --> 02:08.190
But the voice mixed within them...

02:10.020 --> 02:12.520
You're not blaming me?

02:12.520 --> 02:13.650
Really?

02:14.900 --> 02:17.820
You don't have to cower in fear.

02:17.820 --> 02:20.320
Nobody can blame you for anything.

02:21.370 --> 02:26.080
If your past ten years was punishment,
it was a severe one.

02:27.410 --> 02:29.620
Will Akashi be all right?

02:32.500 --> 02:34.210
Natsuiri and Senoh...

02:34.750 --> 02:37.340
And all the pompous guys above them...

02:39.130 --> 02:42.180
They started something incomprehensible on their own...

02:42.180 --> 02:43.720
And when they couldn't stop it,

02:44.220 --> 02:45.890
they rushed out.

02:48.020 --> 02:49.020
It's so selfish!

02:51.560 --> 02:54.150
We all had a lot of tough times,

02:54.820 --> 02:56.900
but we tried our best to do something despite that.

02:58.610 --> 03:01.860
I won't let things end like this!

03:01.860 --> 03:05.160
I'll make sure we settle it with our own hands!

03:05.450 --> 03:10.790
I won't let anything else precious be taken!

03:11.460 --> 03:12.500
Akashi!

03:12.500 --> 03:13.630
Come back to us!

03:14.500 --> 03:17.340
I won't forgive you if you don't!

03:17.340 --> 03:18.380
Akashi!

03:18.380 --> 03:19.260
You need to come back!

03:19.720 --> 03:21.090
Akashi-kun!

03:21.090 --> 03:22.390
Minashi-kun!

03:22.390 --> 03:23.850
Sasame-chan!

03:23.850 --> 03:25.600
Everyone, please come back!

03:25.600 --> 03:27.770
Akashi!

03:44.030 --> 03:45.120
Argent...

03:45.620 --> 03:48.080
I want you to resonate with me for a bit longer.

03:51.120 --> 03:53.880
Minashi!

03:58.880 --> 04:00.130
Outside?

04:03.590 --> 04:05.300
An Arbornine!

04:05.300 --> 04:06.050
It can't be.

04:06.050 --> 04:08.060
Is this because of psyche encroachment?

04:08.970 --> 04:10.180
This place...

04:13.690 --> 04:14.400
What...

04:14.400 --> 04:14.980
What is this stuff?

04:14.980 --> 04:16.440
Something's coming!

04:16.440 --> 04:17.400
I'm scared!

04:17.400 --> 04:18.150
Don't!

04:28.530 --> 04:29.830
You shouldn't run away!

04:32.000 --> 04:34.210
Sasame, Minashi...

04:34.210 --> 04:35.670
Let's all go back together.

04:35.670 --> 04:39.340
Akashi-kun and the others want to leave.

04:39.340 --> 04:40.630
Sasame!

04:41.340 --> 04:42.590
Akashi-kun!

04:42.590 --> 04:44.180
Everyone else, come here!

04:44.180 --> 04:45.760
Sasame!

04:45.760 --> 04:50.640
That day, we all were just plain scared and ran for our lives.

04:52.350 --> 04:55.980
And when we were leaving the
Lightless Realm, our minds got wiped.

04:57.020 --> 05:00.570
When I came to, I was being carried on Aoshi's back.

05:03.820 --> 05:06.030
We'll run all the way through here,

05:06.280 --> 05:09.240
so hold your breath and the Arbornine fruit.

05:09.990 --> 05:11.910
We're not supposed to go outside.

05:12.910 --> 05:16.250
Besides, Tsugumi-chan will be all alone.

05:17.330 --> 05:19.590
We'll be fine for a short while.

05:19.590 --> 05:23.260
We can go right back after seeing Akashi-kun and the others off.

05:24.300 --> 05:24.720
Yeah.

05:28.050 --> 05:29.800
Why?

05:29.800 --> 05:33.520
Akashi promised he'd be with me forever.

05:34.350 --> 05:35.520
Why are you taking him?

05:36.440 --> 05:40.110
Answer me! Why are you taking him?

05:40.110 --> 05:43.190
I don't want to be alone, Sasame...

05:43.190 --> 05:44.110
Tsugumi...

05:44.570 --> 05:45.990
You need to get out of here too!

05:46.610 --> 05:48.610
Escape like everyone else!

05:49.490 --> 05:51.200
Let's go back, Corpse.

05:51.200 --> 05:53.580
I'm sure everyone will come back.

05:56.410 --> 05:57.460
Tsugumi!

05:59.830 --> 06:04.340
Why the hell didn't I take Tsugumi with me back then?

06:04.340 --> 06:05.720
How horrible.

06:07.760 --> 06:09.140
Minashi.

06:09.140 --> 06:12.140
The voice of self-blame in your heart is leaking out.

06:13.180 --> 06:15.770
It's usually sealed so tightly too.

06:15.770 --> 06:18.140
I don't care about that!

06:18.140 --> 06:19.230
We're leaving!

06:19.520 --> 06:22.190
We can save everyone if we have the Lightless Stone!

06:22.940 --> 06:27.190
This space is a creation based on the memory of your sin.

06:27.780 --> 06:28.530
What?

06:29.660 --> 06:32.410
You want to be forgiven for all your sins.

06:33.160 --> 06:35.950
For you to openly show your tormented heart...

06:36.290 --> 06:39.250
It's because you want your weak self to be forgiven.

06:39.250 --> 06:41.580
That's what your heart is truly saying.

06:45.300 --> 06:49.760
In reality, what you want is to
become one and then to erase that sin.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.100
Minashi, you...

06:55.680 --> 06:57.770
It's the Lightless Stone's power.

06:58.310 --> 07:01.060
Inside the Corpse, you have no way of beating me.

07:11.320 --> 07:13.070
We're starting to link.

07:13.820 --> 07:15.910
That's proof you're wishing for this.

07:15.910 --> 07:17.080
Dammit!

07:20.460 --> 07:22.460
It's useless to resist.

07:23.250 --> 07:27.420
After I swallow up all the regrets
floating within the Lightless Realm,

07:27.880 --> 07:34.050
I'll swallow up the humans outside and eventually meld everything into one.

07:34.050 --> 07:37.310
Nobody but you is wishing for that!

07:38.520 --> 07:41.520
I already know no one will understand.

07:41.810 --> 07:46.480
But this is the best course of action, so I won't stop.

07:46.900 --> 07:50.110
My sister's feelings for Natsuiri tormented her.

07:50.110 --> 07:52.910
Just like Tsugumi and Sasame's feelings for you.

07:53.490 --> 07:57.910
The torment from the people  I love are all flooding into me!

07:58.490 --> 07:59.950
I'm sick of it already!

08:01.960 --> 08:04.540
I know of your torment too, Akashi.

08:05.330 --> 08:07.880
You've hurt many people.

08:08.170 --> 08:13.010
Your big brother, Emiru, Sasame, and Tsugumi too.

08:13.800 --> 08:16.720
But because of that, you feel tormented as well.

08:18.640 --> 08:22.480
I don't want anyone to suffer anymore...

08:22.480 --> 08:23.940
I can't stand it!

08:24.850 --> 08:26.980
So let's just put an end to all this already...

08:26.980 --> 08:28.650
All these sad things.

08:29.730 --> 08:30.860
Minashi...

08:34.360 --> 08:36.490
Susan, sorry to make you wait.

08:39.200 --> 08:41.250
They were swallowed by the Corpse?

08:41.250 --> 08:44.500
Raika and the others can't link with Akashi either,

08:44.500 --> 08:47.290
so we have no idea what's going on inside.

08:48.460 --> 08:52.380
The outer wall's continuing to
grow by taking in Admonitions.

08:52.380 --> 08:55.430
The Arbornine fruit has likely already lost its effect too.

08:56.260 --> 08:57.300
So what now?

08:57.850 --> 09:02.180
If the resonance power that drew Heito in can work in our favor, then...

09:04.310 --> 09:05.190
Tsugumi-san?

09:06.350 --> 09:08.770
Can you try calling the Corpse?

09:09.320 --> 09:12.110
But it's with Minashi now.

09:12.110 --> 09:16.950
I think you and the Corpse are linked by a tremendously strong bond.

09:18.280 --> 09:21.620
You were just fine despite being in the Lightless Realm for ten years,

09:22.120 --> 09:24.710
so I don't think it was just the Arbornine's power.

09:32.840 --> 09:36.260
Now, open your heart and take me in.

09:36.930 --> 09:38.300
I'll put you at ease.

09:41.100 --> 09:42.060
No...

09:42.060 --> 09:42.810
That's not it.

09:45.770 --> 09:48.560
I'm not wishing for something like that!

09:48.560 --> 09:49.730
Akashi, hold on...

09:49.730 --> 09:51.400
Tsugumi and Sasame are the same!

09:51.900 --> 09:54.780
You don't get how Sasame feels at all!

09:54.780 --> 09:55.650
Let go!

09:55.650 --> 09:56.360
Akashi!

09:57.610 --> 09:59.450
Wishing for that is definitely...

10:08.540 --> 10:09.420
Sasame...

10:12.090 --> 10:13.420
An illusion?

10:13.960 --> 10:16.340
I heard your voice, Akashi-kun.

10:17.010 --> 10:18.970
You resonated with him...

10:19.390 --> 10:21.890
The ending you talk about...

10:21.890 --> 10:23.430
It's not something I wish for either.

10:32.310 --> 10:34.690
Sasame, you came to rescue me...

10:35.570 --> 10:37.820
You called for me, Akashi-kun.

10:38.950 --> 10:42.160
Sasame, you're going to accept Akashi?

10:43.740 --> 10:46.080
You'll further add to your sins?

10:46.830 --> 10:49.370
I want to stop you, no matter what.

10:49.370 --> 10:51.330
I feel the same way.

10:51.330 --> 10:54.960
If you say that's a sin, I'll accept it!

10:57.420 --> 10:58.840
So that's it...

11:20.780 --> 11:22.160
The Corpse?

11:22.740 --> 11:25.780
Akashi-kun, I want you to pilot me.

11:27.120 --> 11:29.960
I don't care how much I get hurt.

11:29.960 --> 11:33.540
Pilot me and stop Minashi-kun.

11:33.540 --> 11:35.500
Is that all right, Sasame?

12:06.280 --> 12:11.040
Trying to get you to join me was my biggest mistake.

12:11.660 --> 12:14.000
Corpse, eat Akashi!

12:30.140 --> 12:31.680
The vehicle's so light.

12:31.680 --> 12:33.230
It's the same as before.

12:33.730 --> 12:35.810
This feels like my own body.

12:40.780 --> 12:44.320
No, closer and warmer than with Aoshi.

12:44.320 --> 12:45.740
This feeling...

12:46.660 --> 12:48.530
I felt nostalgic.

12:48.530 --> 12:50.490
It was because of your warmth, Sasame.

12:51.700 --> 12:54.120
I could feel it without being connected.

12:54.120 --> 12:56.250
It was your warmth, Akashi-kun.

12:58.540 --> 13:01.300
I feel that warmth again now!

13:02.050 --> 13:03.220
Akashi!

13:03.220 --> 13:04.010
Sasame!

13:04.300 --> 13:06.220
It's that strong link again!

13:06.590 --> 13:07.930
They're fighting?

13:08.510 --> 13:11.310
The outer rim's expansion is accelerating!

13:11.310 --> 13:12.600
We're going in!

13:14.310 --> 13:16.060
Suzaki-san, I'll go with you!

13:23.240 --> 13:25.400
All units, prepare to attack!

13:26.030 --> 13:26.990
Fire!

13:40.380 --> 13:41.670
Corpse...

13:44.210 --> 13:46.050
Sasame, are you all right?

13:46.050 --> 13:46.840
Yeah.

13:49.140 --> 13:50.600
We have to finish this quickly!

14:07.450 --> 14:08.910
Minashi, give up!

14:30.340 --> 14:34.310
I didn't want to take such forceful means.

14:37.680 --> 14:38.770
Akashi-kun!

14:39.100 --> 14:40.940
Stop it, Minashi-kun!

14:40.940 --> 14:42.980
Bear with it a short while, Sasame.

14:43.610 --> 14:45.980
I'll bring Tsugumi here soon too.

14:51.910 --> 14:54.280
The Lightless Realm's effects are strong!

14:54.740 --> 14:56.870
It's this rough even with Arbornine?

14:57.960 --> 14:58.910
Tazaki!

14:58.910 --> 14:59.580
Yes!

15:00.080 --> 15:02.040
Emiru, they're all...

15:08.300 --> 15:08.880
Not even a scratch?

15:08.880 --> 15:10.050
Impossible...

15:11.430 --> 15:13.600
Why doesn't anyone understand?

15:14.470 --> 15:18.100
Erase... Erase... Erase...

15:18.600 --> 15:19.640
Admonitions?

15:20.310 --> 15:24.060
The voices of regret that the Corpse swallowed up.

15:30.400 --> 15:33.570
The Corpse is crying...

15:36.410 --> 15:37.410
Corpse...

15:43.330 --> 15:44.460
Tsugumi-san...

15:45.840 --> 15:48.710
Corpse is... crying...

15:50.010 --> 15:54.300
It's suffering from so much hatred that it can't cradle.

15:54.300 --> 15:56.050
It's crying from the torment...

15:56.760 --> 15:58.180
It's all my fault.

15:59.560 --> 16:02.600
You are children of sin.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.730
Everything is your fault.

16:05.230 --> 16:06.650
They're all sinners.

16:06.650 --> 16:09.320
They can all suffer without exception!

16:09.820 --> 16:12.280
Everyone should just die!

16:13.360 --> 16:15.370
It's because I wished for this.

16:18.200 --> 16:27.460
It stayed at my side the whole time and kept silently taking in my corrupt feelings...

16:29.880 --> 16:31.380
Tsugumi-san, wait!

16:31.670 --> 16:37.300
The Corpse didn't wish to fight at all, but it did it because I asked for him to.

16:39.100 --> 16:42.350
I was the one who turned Corpse into this form.

16:42.350 --> 16:45.600
I'm the one who has to atone for my sin.

16:47.900 --> 16:49.320
I'm sorry, Corpse...

16:50.610 --> 16:51.780
I'm sorry.

16:54.860 --> 16:56.320
Tsugumi's voice...

17:05.790 --> 17:07.420
Wh-What's this?

17:10.000 --> 17:11.210
Minashi!

17:11.510 --> 17:12.630
Corpse!

17:12.630 --> 17:14.170
What's wrong, Corpse?

17:14.630 --> 17:16.890
Everyone, we're going to rescue Minashi!

17:17.640 --> 17:18.510
Right!

17:19.350 --> 17:20.180
Emiru!

17:22.060 --> 17:23.480
Roger...

17:28.150 --> 17:28.980
Raika.

17:30.770 --> 17:31.570
Iwato...

17:32.280 --> 17:33.900
It sure was worth a shot.

17:34.490 --> 17:36.450
We're resonating, right?

17:37.410 --> 17:38.570
Perhaps.

17:38.570 --> 17:39.700
Dammit.

17:40.200 --> 17:42.870
It's impossible without resonance after all.

17:46.250 --> 17:47.250
Tazaki?

17:48.630 --> 17:51.960
I feel slightly better now.

18:12.900 --> 18:15.740
You guys are all insane.

18:21.830 --> 18:25.830
If we're still separated, sad things will keep happening.

18:26.540 --> 18:28.710
We have to link together as one.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.380
Won't hands do?

18:35.510 --> 18:37.340
That's not enough.

18:37.340 --> 18:38.760
You'll get separated.

18:38.760 --> 18:40.930
Then we'll reach out again.

18:44.390 --> 18:46.850
When we get separated, we'll reach out again.

18:46.850 --> 18:48.980
Over and over.

18:49.810 --> 18:53.860
Even if sad things happen,
we'll still continue to reach out again.

18:57.740 --> 19:00.280
We can be linked together,

19:01.700 --> 19:02.950
even if we're not all one.

19:17.670 --> 19:19.010
I'm sorry...

19:20.010 --> 19:22.640
And thank you, Corpse.

19:25.680 --> 19:26.970
The Lightless...

19:26.970 --> 19:28.600
A darkness with no light.

19:29.350 --> 19:33.190
Within it, people can only search for things by touch.

19:34.520 --> 19:41.950
However, that giant darkness was finally about to be brushed away.

19:44.490 --> 19:51.920
Perhaps it may only be the beginning of another distant, long tale.

19:58.710 --> 19:58.760
MEMORIAL MONUMENT

20:03.510 --> 20:04.180
Here we go!

20:09.180 --> 20:15.150
One, two, three, four, five...

20:15.650 --> 20:19.650
The Necrometal mechanism
hasn't been fully explicated yet.

20:20.570 --> 20:27.660
But it's been confirmed that the patient's memory is useful in restoring the overwritten existence data.

20:28.330 --> 20:31.660
You need a partner who shares the memory, correct?

20:32.460 --> 20:36.460
I believe strong attachment to objects is also effective.

20:46.470 --> 20:47.970
All right!

20:47.970 --> 20:49.470
You're way too serious!

20:49.470 --> 20:51.060
We're playing against kids!

20:51.060 --> 20:52.430
But the same goes for you.

20:57.190 --> 20:59.400
All right, one more!

21:00.900 --> 21:05.410
Concerning the Lightless Realm's
root cause, the Yomijima massacre,

21:05.410 --> 21:08.490
which former Deputy Cabinet
Secretary Onohara acknowledged...

21:10.450 --> 21:12.620
Oh, I remember now...

21:13.290 --> 21:17.830
Realizing that you didn't have a heart was the worst terror I've ever felt.

21:19.040 --> 21:26.300
If I untangle the clump of resentful hearts, are there warm feelings among them?

21:27.550 --> 21:30.260
I had forgotten all that...

21:31.180 --> 21:33.520
To face my own feelings.

21:35.600 --> 21:39.150
Would you like to hear other stories besides Mahsa's?

21:39.690 --> 21:41.110
Not at all?

21:41.900 --> 21:44.190
Well, that's what I expected, but...

21:54.960 --> 21:56.040
Akashi.

21:57.170 --> 21:59.380
Tsugumi, that's dangerous.

22:00.840 --> 22:04.340
I like the view that I can see from here.

22:06.130 --> 22:08.220
More and more are restored...

22:08.720 --> 22:12.310
And more and more change and move on.

22:12.720 --> 22:17.100
When I see that feelings and
scenery don't stagnate in one spot,

22:17.100 --> 22:18.810
it reassures me so much.

22:20.560 --> 22:21.940
You're right.

22:21.940 --> 22:24.110
Heading over to see Sasame?

22:24.110 --> 22:24.900
Yeah.

22:26.110 --> 22:28.700
Have you gone to see her yet?

22:29.200 --> 22:29.950
Yeah.

22:30.490 --> 22:31.990
Just a few moments ago.

22:31.990 --> 22:33.910
I was finally able to apologize.

22:33.910 --> 22:38.160
She went so far as to turning into something like that.

22:38.670 --> 22:40.790
Why couldn't I see her desire to repent?

22:41.590 --> 22:43.670
When she remembered me,

22:44.170 --> 22:49.130
I'm sure she was more thankful than anyone that I was still alive.

22:49.880 --> 22:52.640
I knew she was that kind of girl.

22:53.220 --> 22:54.600
It's because of the Lightless Realm.

22:55.970 --> 22:57.980
You're so kind, Akashi.

22:58.810 --> 23:01.060
I went to go see her with Corpse.

23:02.060 --> 23:03.020
Corpse too?

23:03.690 --> 23:04.820
That's right.

23:04.820 --> 23:05.980
I snuck it in.

23:06.860 --> 23:08.150
Corpse?

23:09.990 --> 23:11.820
Where did it go?

23:12.370 --> 23:13.990
It's so hopeless...

23:27.420 --> 23:30.300
Darkness is never born as darkness.

23:31.470 --> 23:35.510
It is born when light is lost.

23:36.770 --> 23:41.480
The same is said for the darkness within one's heart.

23:55.950 --> 23:57.450
The light was here.

23:58.200 --> 24:00.870
Surely, it was right here.

24:06.500 --> 24:06.540
The Dark Metal

24:07.300 --> 24:10.010
The End
